title Cassette state (PLAY/PAUSE key, hubs, meter): recording: REC latched, PAUSE not latched (what a press does), both hubs counterclockwise
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 2
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot state-recording
expect text "PAUSE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
